/target/
**/*.rs.bk
*.profraw
*.profdata
perf.data*

# Work-package worktrees (one per delegated WP; see docs/plan/11 §Delegation mechanics)
/.worktrees/

# Fuzzing (cargo-fuzz)
/fuzz/target/
/fuzz/artifacts/
/fuzz/corpus/
